No physical or electrical modification was made to the HELPStat hardware
design. ElectroStat reuses the original board and driver as-is, adding WiFi,
USB-serial and manual RTIA gain selection, microSD backup logging, and new
measurement/analysis capabilities on top of it, in the ESP32-S3 firmware,
the Python bridge ([bridge.py](bridge.py)), and this web application.
